<title>LIBERIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>LIBERIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970724)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 24 Jul 97 - Charles Taylor was declared president	   *</p>
<p> *		 following the July 19 election. He won 75.3   *</p>
<p> *		 per cent of the vote against 9.6 for his	*</p>
<p> *		 nearest rival Ellen Johnson-Sirleaf.	    *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>President (see note above).....Charles TAYLOR</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>COUNCIL OF STATE (Installed 1 Sep 95):</p>
<p>Chairman (Inaugurated 3 Sep 96)....Ruth PERRY</p>
<p>  Other Members...........Victoria RIFELL (NPP)</p>
<p>							Vamba KANNEH (ALCOP)</p>
<p>						  Weade Kobbah WREH (NDPL)</p>
<p>								   Oscar QUIAH</p>
<p>							  Chief Tamba TAILOR</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>  Agriculture............Roland MASSAQUOI (NPP)</p>
<p>Commerce..Thomas BRIMA (ALCOP)</p>
<p>  Defence..........General Hezekiah BOWEN (AFL)</p>
<p>Education....Moses BAAH (NDPL)</p>
<p>  Finance................Lansana KROMAH (ALCOP)</p>
<p>  Foreign Affairs............Monie CAPTAN (NPP)</p>
<p>  Health &amp; Social Welfare............Jamesetta JOHNSON (ALCOP)</p>
<p>Information...Joe MULBAH (NPP)</p>
<p>  Internal Affairs..........Edward SACKOR (NPP)</p>
<p>Justice.....Peter JALLAH (NPP)</p>
<p>  Labour.............Tom WOEWIYU</p>
<p>Lands, Mines &amp; Energy.....Jenkins DUMBA (NPP)</p>
<p>  Planning &amp; Economic Affairs............Francis CABAH (ALCOP)</p>
<p>  Posts &amp; Telecommunications..............Alfred KOLLIE (NDPL)</p>
<p>  Public Works.............Varlee KEITA (ALCOP)</p>
<p>  Rural Development.........Amos LINCOLN (NDPL)</p>
<p>Transport....Roosevelt JOHNSON</p>
<p>  Youth &amp; Sports......Francois MASSAQUOI (NDPL)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTER OF STATE</p>
<p>Presidential Affairs....Charles BREEZE (NDPL)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTIES/FACTIONS:</p>
<p>NPP - Charles Taylor's National Patriotic Party of Liberia</p>
<p>	  (ex-National Patriotic Front of Liberia)</p>
<p>ALCOP - Kromah's All Liberia Coalition Party</p>
<p>	    (ex-ULIMO-K)</p>
<p>NDPL - Boley's National Democratic Party of Liberia</p>
<p>	   (Old ruling party grouping ex-Liberia Peace Council)</p>
<p>AFL  - Armed Forces of Liberia (former National Army)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>  Central Bank Governor...........Ignatius CLAY</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
